      "doctor_question": "Hello, please have a seat. What brings you in to see me today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S019",
      "patient_response": "Thank you, Doctor. I really appreciate you seeing me. I, um... I hope I'm not taking up too much of your time. \n\nI'm here mostly because... well, people keep acting like I'm just imagining things. And I don't want you to think I'm making a fuss or being difficult, I promise I'm not. It's just that I know the hospital people, and some of the folks from the agency where I work—I do housekeeping—I know they've been watching our house. And they keep an eye on my cleaning routes, too. \n\nI'm pretty sure they just want to see if I'm taking proper care of my husband. I try so hard to be a good wife and do everything right for him. I mean, I guess it makes sense they'd want to check on us, right? But it's just been making me a little anxious... is it okay that I feel a little overwhelmed by that?",
